sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Operator as Operateur
  participant FE as Frontend Next.js
  participant GW as API Gateway GraphQL
  participant Guard as GqlJwtAuthGuard
  participant Traffic as Traffic Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Notif as Notification Service
  participant WS as WebSocket /notifications

  FE->>WS: Connexion Socket.IO
  WS-->>FE: Connexion acceptee

  Operator->>FE: Lance une mesure de densite
  FE->>GW: mutation measureTrafficDensity(input)\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT
  GW->>Traffic: Forward mutation + Authorization
  Traffic->>Guard: Validation JWT
  alt Token absent ou invalide
    Guard-->>Traffic: Unauthorized
    Traffic-->>GW: Erreur GraphQL
    GW-->>FE: Erreur GraphQL
    FE-->>Operator: Affiche acces refuse
  else Token valide OPERATOR/ADMIN
    Traffic->>DB: Charge TrafficZone
    Traffic->>Traffic: Calcule densite et niveau LOW/MEDIUM/HIGH
    Traffic->>DB: Met a jour TrafficZone
    alt Congestion detectee HIGH
      Traffic->>Notif: mutation createNotificationFromEvent\nTraffic alert
      Notif->>DB: Cree Notification globale ou ciblee
      Notif->>WS: Emet notification temps reel
      WS-->>FE: Notification recue
      FE->>FE: Met a jour centre de notifications
    else Pas de congestion critique
      Traffic-->>GW: TrafficZone mise a jour
    end
    Traffic-->>GW: TrafficZone mise a jour
    GW-->>FE: Resultat mesure densite
    FE->>FE: Rafraichit zone sur la carte
  end
